    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "*** DEREK DORGAN AUCTIONEER BALLINCOLLIG (021)4871777 (086)0483003 ***\r\n\r\nWe are delighted to present to the market, this charming traditional cottage type property together with C.0.6 acre. This home enjoys a beautiful rural, peaceful setting, just C.13 KM from Kinsale Town.  \r\nNew roof slates were fitted in recent years plus a fitted solid fuel stove and oil burner. The master bedroom features exposed traditional stone walls retaining and complimenting the unique charm and character of this cottage.\r\nThis two-bedroom detached Cottage is perfect choice for a first-time buyer, a client wishing to right size, someone who may enjoy nature and the silence of the countryside or someone who simply wishes to acquire an idyllic holiday home within close proximity of Kinsale Town. As this property is situated on C.0.6 acre, it allows for massive future potential, for further development to extend to this home.\r\n \r\nThis comprises of a Kitchen/dining room, Lounge, Two Double bedrooms and a main bathroom"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hallway \r\n4’1” X 3’2”\r\nThis hall leadings into the lounge.\r\n\r\nINFO SUPPLIED SUBJECT TO CONTRACT\r\nDerek Dorgan Auctioneer & Letting Agents for themselves and for the venders or lessors of the property whose Agents they are, give notice (i) The particulars are set out as a general outline for the guidance of intending purchasers or lessees, and do not constitute part of, an offer or contract. (ii) All descriptions, dimensions, reference to condition and necessary permissions for use and occupation, and other details are given in good faith and are believed to be correct, but any intending purchasers or tenants should not rely on them as statements or representations of fact must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them. (iii) No person in the employment of Messrs. Derek Dorgan Auctioneer & Letting Agents has any authority to make or give representation or warranty whatever in relation to this development.   \r\nLounge\r\n14’6” X 11’7”\r\nThis room has wooden floor and a large open fireplace with a fitted stove\r\nThe lounge leads right to the master bedroom, straight ahead to the kitchen/ dining area and left to the second bedroom\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nMaster bedroom\r\n15’7” X 9’3”\r\nThis is the feature room in the house. \r\nWith exposed stone walls, wooden floors and benefits dual aspect\r\nIt also has dual access points \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom Two\r\n14’7” X 7’8”\r\nThis room also has a wooden floor and benefits dual aspect\r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining area\r\n11’6” X 9’11”\r\nThis room can also be entered via the via external door.\r\nIt has fitted kitchen units\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n9’8” X 5’9”\r\nThe walls are tiled around the corner shower\r\nWHB & Toilet\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBlocked built Outbuilding\r\n14’8” X 13’8”\r\nDouble garage door access"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Prime Location – C.13 KM To Kinsale, C.11 KM To Cork International Airport, C.6 KM To Ballinhassig, C.7 KM To Ballygarvan and C.17 KM To Cork City\r\nPeaceful, countryside setting\r\nRecent upgraded oil boiler\r\nFeature stone walls finish in the master bedroom\r\nNew slate roof\r\nTwo bedrooms\r\nOn C.0.6 acre site"
      },
